message: "If grip helped your work, please cite it."
type: software
title: "grip: keep a grip on your code"
abstract: "A git hook that quizzes developers about their own diff before it is committed or pushed. Five questions written from the diff by a language model, a hidden rubric, a Grip Score out of 100 and a pass mark the team chooses."
